      "markdown": "<!-- PageHeader: Northwind Home Loan Policy Document layout demonstration -->\n\n\n# 1. Purpose\n\nThis policy defines the review process for fictional home-loan applications.\n\n\n# 2. Required Documents\n\nApplicants provide identification, income evidence, and property details.\n\n\n# 3. Review Timeline\n\nThe operations team completes each stage according to the table below.\n\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Stage</th>\n<th>Owner</th>\n<th>Target</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intake</td>\n<td>Coordinator</td>\n<td>1 day</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Verification</td>\n<td>Analyst</td>\n<td>2 days</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decision</td>\n<td>Underwriter</td>\n<td>3 days</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n# 4. Approval Checklist\n\n[ ] Identity verified\n\n[ ] Income reviewed\n\n[ ] Property details confirmed\n\n<!-- PageFooter: FICTIONAL DEMO DATA -->\n",
